# {{project_name}}

<!-- stacks:fill One or two sentences on what this API does and who calls it. -->

A FastAPI JSON API run by Uvicorn. `openapi.json` is the committed API contract; `make check-openapi` fails when it no longer matches the app.

## Quickstart

Requires [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) and make.

```bash
cp .env.example .env
make install
make dev        # API on :8000 with reload
```

Open http://localhost:8000/docs for the interactive API docs.

## Commands

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make dev` | Run the API with reload |
| `make start` | Run the API without reload |
| `make lint` / `make format` | Check / fix lint and formatting |
| `make typecheck` | mypy strict |
| `make test` | Tests |
| `make coverage` | Tests with the coverage floor |
| `make openapi` | Rewrite `openapi.json` after a route or model change |

Run `make help` for the full list.

## Layout

```
app/        FastAPI app: factory, config, routers, schemas, services
scripts/    dump_openapi.py
tests/      pytest suite against the real app
```

